title Resume pedalling while already rolling at 20 km/h (level 3)

# Coasting at speed, then the rider starts pedalling again at 70 rpm.
# On a torque-sensor bike assist is there on the first push.
at 0 speed 20
at 3000 cadence 70
at 7000 cadence 0

end 8000

# Baseline: rolling at speed doesn't help; assist still waits for 90 deg of crank.
expect 3200 current == 0
expect 3250 current > 0
